---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import photo from '../assets/photo.jpg';
---

<Base
  title="Renato Molina Toth"
  description="CTO, hands-on technical leader, and software engineer. Building products with craft, leading teams with clarity."
>
  <div slot="bg" class="glow-orb" id="orb"></div>

  <header>
    <div class="header-row">
      <Image src={photo} alt="Renato Molina Toth" width={220} class="avatar" loading="eager" />
      <div>
        <h1>Renato <span class="gradient">Molina Toth</span></h1>
        <p class="role-line">Chief Technology Officer & Tech Lead at <a href="https://skillsetter.com" target="_blank">Skillsetter</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="intro">
    <p>I'm a CTO who still builds every day, just not by typing code anymore. I ship through an AI-driven pipeline built on solid engineering practices and metrics I can actually trust. I set the technical direction, shape the product with the team, and ship right alongside them. At a growing company the CTO wears every hat, and that's exactly how I like it.</p>
    <p>I've been building products since 2011 and leading the teams behind them for most of that time. I've been CTO three times, co-founded a startup, taken hardware from first prototype to mass production, and built a SaaS platform from the ground up. That taught me that <strong>craft</strong> compounds: clean architecture, agile that actually works, and teams that ship with confidence. I'm opinionated about what good software looks like, and I keep the bar high.</p>
    <p>Beyond my own workflow, I'm deep in <strong>AI and LLMs</strong>: putting them into real products, learning where they break, and helping teams adopt them without the hype. I've also built the engineering processes behind <strong>SOC 2</strong> compliance, the kind that make security audits boring. The good kind of boring.</p>
    <p>Based in Vancouver, Canada 🇨🇦</p>
  </section>

  <section class="connect">
    <div class="links">
      <a href="https://github.com/renatomolina" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="GitHub">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/renatomolinat" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="https://x.com/renatomolinat" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="X (Twitter)">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .bg-glow-1 {
    width: 700px;
    height: 700px;
    top: -100px;
    right: -200px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.07) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  .bg-glow-2 {
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    bottom: 10%;
    left: -150px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  .glow-orb {
    position: fixed;
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.06) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .glow-orb { display: none; }
  }

  header { animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); }

  .header-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .avatar {
    width: 110px;
    height: 110px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    padding: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gradient-start), var(--gradient-end));
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  h1 .gradient {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gradient-start), var(--gradient-end));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .role-line {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .role-line a {
    color: var(--accent-light);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .role-line a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--accent-light); }

  .intro {
    padding: 56px 0 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.1s both;
  }

  .intro p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .intro p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .intro p:first-child {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .intro strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .connect {
    padding: 48px 0 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.3s both;
  }

  .links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .links a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .links a:hover {
    color: var(--text);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .links a svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
</style>

<script>
  const orb = document.getElementById('orb');
  document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {
    if (orb) orb.style.transform = `translate(${e.clientX - 250}px, ${e.clientY - 250}px)`;
  });
</script>
